Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us build a Digital Brain using the CarePath documents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,in our project. Start with just one file: user stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We will follow one example, tracking a referral. A referral
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,is a request for a patient to see another care
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,team. Watch how this one file becomes connected knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After upload checks, MarkItDown converts the Word file into readable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,text. Here is the actual heading: U S zero eight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Track a referral, F R zero eight. Below it is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the referral lifecycle. Django keeps this text with its source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,identifier and content fingerprint. Every extracted fact can point back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to this file.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The normal graph begins with a document node. A node
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,is simply an item. Our Python builder adds section nodes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,for the heading and ordinary text lines. Arrows connect the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:01:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,document to those sections and mean contains section. The same
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,approach handles other content, including table rows and values. We
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,are showing a small part of this larger graph. So
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,far, we have captured the structure of the document.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now enable optional A I enrichment. OpenAI or Claude reads
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the text and proposes typed relationships. Look at the highlighted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,heading. U S zero eight is a user story, and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,F R zero eight is a requirement. They become two
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,business nodes, joined by references. The proposal carries the original
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,source and exact quotation. The document structure stays in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,graph underneath this new business layer. These links are still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,proposals at this point; evidence checks decide whether they can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,be accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.20,0:01:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now upload the architecture document. Its component table connects F
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,R zero eight to domain slash referral underscore state dot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,py. That is the code module for the referral lifecycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:02:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The graph grows a code node and an implemented in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.99,0:02:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,connection. Notice that F R zero eight is the same
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.94,0:02:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,requirement. Next, add the traceability spreadsheet. Its row connects Test
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lifecycle Map with F R zero eight. A test node
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,grows into the graph, joined by verifies. Three different files
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,now describe one connected story: what we need, where it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is implemented, and how it is tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Before accepting links, the application checks the source, exact quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.97,0:02:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,named items, and allowed types and relationships. Matching names and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,types become one shared requirement node. Each accepted connection keeps
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,its supporting document. F R zero eight joins the story,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,code, and tests. These checks filter unsupported proposals; a person
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,still reviews meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare search adds a search structure beside the graph. With
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,embeddings enabled, OpenAI converts text into a numerical vector. Watch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the text become numbers and enter the search index. The
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,numbers represent meaning, not new graph facts. Later, a question
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,such as, how do we test referral tracking, gets its
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,own vector. Similarity search can find relevant text. Graph traversal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,follows links to the requirement and tests. These vector values
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,are illustrative; unchanged text can reuse its stored vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Django saves a numbered draft. Graphify uses NetworkX and Leiden
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,clustering to organise existing graph nodes into themes for review.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The graph is now easier to explore across documents. Grouping
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,adds organisation; it does not add new facts or prove
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A reviewer checks the evidence and publishes. Restricted sources are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,excluded, and retrieval checks access and current evidence again. One
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,CarePath file has grown into connected stories, requirements, code, and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,tests, with supporting sources.